{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hi there! Oliver Gumthrow here!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">I'm looking for anyone and everyone capable enough to use a monitor and a mouse! If this sounds like you then you are 100% qualified to be our new expert tech person at Gumthrow Industries!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This very important button needs to be clicked, and you'll be paid for it! That's right money in your pocket, and a secure and stable job! Earn pay raises, customize your workspace, and upgrade your work experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">While clicking the button <strong>do not</strong> get distracted, if you take too long to click the button you'll be terminated and replaced immediately.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After a quick sign up, take your seat, hand on mouse and <strong>click the button!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754540/extras/extraImageButton.png?t=1749940991\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3754540?t=1749940991","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3754540?t=1749940991","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754540/7faacafebb481e5b0757850f0e2430a921219445/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749940991","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754540/7faacafebb481e5b0757850f0e2430a921219445/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749940991","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes"